WEBVTT

00:00:15.010 --> 00:00:22.080
Looking up at the purple panorama of the galaxy highway...

00:00:24.050 --> 00:00:30.190
...a shooting star pierces my heart.

00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:38.000
synchronized with the sleepless city...
My accelerating heartbeat is

00:00:39.280 --> 00:00:44.770
...and I suddenly pray for the unseen tomorrow...

00:00:45.640 --> 00:00:50.010
...that brings that melody.

00:00:51.810 --> 00:00:56.950
A mysterious voice won't let me go.

00:00:57.490 --> 00:01:03.560
Oh, tell me seventh moon, this frustrated heart...

00:01:04.560 --> 00:01:09.330
...where will you take me to?

00:01:09.770 --> 00:01:15.840
To sway in the blue seventh moon...

00:01:16.270 --> 00:01:25.750
...searching for the answer to the rhythm in this crazy dance.

00:01:36.270 --> 00:01:39.300
I won't let people
be kidnapped from City 7 !

00:01:39.950 --> 00:01:42.900
You bastards !
What'd you do with Miss Mylene ?!

00:01:43.740 --> 00:01:46.460
Mylene's a member
of Fire Bomber !

00:01:46.460 --> 00:01:49.240
If our song reaches her,
she'll definitely respond.

00:01:49.240 --> 00:01:50.540
"If our song reaches her ?''

00:01:50.540 --> 00:01:51.650
Basara.

00:01:51.650 --> 00:01:54.770
Spiritia Farm Project.

00:02:02.810 --> 00:02:05.480
The time for my dream
to be realized has come.

00:02:09.820 --> 00:02:13.770
Boroughneize number 3, 5 and 6,
head for area D3 and begin scanning.

00:02:15.900 --> 00:02:21.850
FOLD OUT

00:02:36.350 --> 00:02:41.090
This is D2. "Fold in area''
wake hasn't been located yet.

00:02:41.090 --> 00:02:43.170
Continuing search.

00:02:43.170 --> 00:02:44.170
Roger.

00:02:44.870 --> 00:02:47.350
Miss Mylene,
I pray for your safety.

00:03:13.620 --> 00:03:17.920
City 7, City 7, this is the
Battle 7 Bridge. Please respond.

00:03:17.920 --> 00:03:21.090
This is the bridge.
City 7, respond please.

00:03:21.090 --> 00:03:25.850
Left behind. I didn't think
the enemy would take City 7.

00:04:05.660 --> 00:04:13.270
De-fold location confirmed.
Coordinates 05SX46KY77MZ.

00:04:13.270 --> 00:04:17.590
Why didn't we fold out at the
coordinates ordered by Gepelnitch ?

00:04:17.590 --> 00:04:22.300
This system is incapable of
such a long range fold.

00:04:22.300 --> 00:04:26.370
Immediately adjust the psi-fold with new
coordinates for new de-fold location.

00:04:26.370 --> 00:04:32.580
The input of new coordinates and psi-fold
recharge will take approximately 7 hours.

00:04:32.580 --> 00:04:37.170
Begin immediately.
Gepelnitch's plan must not fail.

00:04:37.170 --> 00:04:38.180
Yes, sir.

00:04:44.620 --> 00:04:47.940
Papa and Gamlin
must be worried.

00:04:51.620 --> 00:04:52.960
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:04:52.960 --> 00:04:55.770
The situation's gotten worse.

00:04:56.420 --> 00:04:58.950
Can't be helped.

00:04:58.950 --> 00:05:00.970
Don't say such
irresponsible things !

00:05:00.970 --> 00:05:04.030
But, even the TV
station's like this.

00:05:04.630 --> 00:05:06.370
Dear citizens, this is your mayor,
Miria Farina Jenius.

00:05:06.370 --> 00:05:07.370
Mama.
Dear citizens, this is your mayor,
Miria Farina Jenius.

00:05:07.370 --> 00:05:08.950
Dear citizens, this is your mayor,
Miria Farina Jenius.

00:05:08.950 --> 00:05:12.020
Everyone, please listen carefully.

00:05:12.020 --> 00:05:17.720
City 7 has been detached from Battle 7
and is now floating free in space.

00:05:17.720 --> 00:05:22.050
We are searching for the reason,
but there's no cause for alarm.

00:05:22.050 --> 00:05:27.270
City 7's life support system is functioning normally and there is no danger.

00:05:27.920 --> 00:05:31.100
All citizens,
please remain calm.

00:05:34.030 --> 00:05:34.960
What the...?

00:05:34.960 --> 00:05:38.160
I wonder what kind of
greeting he's gonna give us ?

00:05:40.560 --> 00:05:45.500
We have taken control
of all your main systems.

00:05:45.500 --> 00:05:49.420
We will kill anyone
attempting to restore control.

00:05:51.170 --> 00:05:52.230
I see.

00:05:52.230 --> 00:05:56.270
What do you mean, "I see ?''
We're prisoners of the enemy !

00:05:56.770 --> 00:05:58.780
Doesn't matter.

00:05:58.780 --> 00:06:01.080
What do you mean,
"Doesn't matter ?!''

00:06:01.080 --> 00:06:05.690
Mylene, could you take
us to Mayor Miria ?

00:06:05.690 --> 00:06:07.390
Huh ?
To Mom ?

00:06:08.830 --> 00:06:11.990
All attempts at
access are being denied.

00:06:11.990 --> 00:06:14.170
Our main computer
has been overridden.

00:06:14.970 --> 00:06:17.140
Our airlocks have
been locked shut.

00:06:17.140 --> 00:06:20.000
We cannot escape
City 7 to space.

00:06:20.000 --> 00:06:22.760
Where would we escape to ?

00:06:29.630 --> 00:06:31.260
Quiet, isn't it ?

00:06:31.260 --> 00:06:35.270
I wonder if everyone understands that no
matter what we attempt, it's impossible.

00:06:36.740 --> 00:06:41.850
If the citizens started a riot,
I'd have an excuse to dump everyone.

00:06:42.260 --> 00:06:43.570
M...Mayor !

00:06:45.250 --> 00:06:46.200
Just kidding.

00:06:48.390 --> 00:06:52.650
New coordinates, input.
Currently starting recharge of fold system.

00:06:52.650 --> 00:06:55.600
We're 400 seconds
behind schedule. Hurry.

00:06:55.600 --> 00:06:56.370
Yes, sir.

00:07:07.170 --> 00:07:08.170
What's that ?

00:07:14.850 --> 00:07:19.740
This is D2. This is D2. I've found
a sample. I'm bringing it back.

00:07:19.740 --> 00:07:20.450
Roger.

00:07:20.890 --> 00:07:23.430
The fold system
is recharging ?

00:07:23.430 --> 00:07:29.680
Yes, at this pace, a psi-fold
will occur in the next four hours.

00:07:31.200 --> 00:07:33.220
Midnight's the time limit.

00:07:34.320 --> 00:07:35.900
We have to do
something before then.

00:07:37.870 --> 00:07:38.970
It's open.

00:07:39.920 --> 00:07:40.920
Mama !

00:07:41.740 --> 00:07:42.740
Mylene !

00:07:43.470 --> 00:07:45.500
How did you people
get in here ?

00:07:45.500 --> 00:07:49.270
Right now, City 7's security
is nowhere to be seen.

00:07:49.770 --> 00:07:52.270
It's a free pass
to anywhere !

00:07:52.780 --> 00:07:57.210
Stop that immediately !
What rude people ! Get out !

00:07:58.020 --> 00:08:02.020
It's alright. They're all
"acquaintances'' of mine.

00:08:03.160 --> 00:08:04.870
Anyway, what brings you here ?

00:08:05.770 --> 00:08:09.090
We came to ask
permission to go wild.

00:08:09.090 --> 00:08:11.000
Go wild ?

00:08:11.680 --> 00:08:15.720
Captain, the test results
are in on the sample.

00:08:15.720 --> 00:08:16.450
Really ?

00:08:16.450 --> 00:08:26.270
Using x-rays, the data indicates that it
comes from coordinates 05SX46KY77MZ.

00:08:26.270 --> 00:08:29.730
Good. Open fold communications
channel to those coordinates.

00:08:29.730 --> 00:08:30.720
Yes, sir.

00:08:31.380 --> 00:08:33.760
Just as you thought, Captain.

00:08:33.760 --> 00:08:36.720
Due to dimensional transposition...

00:08:36.720 --> 00:08:41.980
...folding something as large as City 7
will always leave a traceable wake.

00:08:43.580 --> 00:08:47.000
No response on City 7's
fold communications channel.

00:08:47.000 --> 00:08:47.890
Continue.

00:08:47.890 --> 00:08:48.780
Roger.

00:08:49.330 --> 00:08:53.390
How long will it take for us
to build enough fold energy ?

00:08:53.390 --> 00:08:55.670
Quite a while,
I suppose.

00:08:56.770 --> 00:09:01.920
The fold energy required to fold to City 7's
coordinates will take 8 hours to build up.

00:09:01.920 --> 00:09:03.380
Eight hours ?

00:09:03.380 --> 00:09:07.270
Captain, a priority message from
Lt. Kinryu of Diamond Force.

00:09:07.970 --> 00:09:09.230
Put him through.

00:09:09.230 --> 00:09:13.270
Captain ! Let us try
using the Fold Booster.

00:09:14.170 --> 00:09:15.720
Fold Booster...

00:09:15.720 --> 00:09:22.580
We plan to use Fold Boosters to fold ahead
to City 7 and take out the enemy in advance.

00:09:22.580 --> 00:09:25.470
That booster
is still experimental.

00:09:25.470 --> 00:09:27.640
It's too dangerous to
use over long distances.

00:09:27.640 --> 00:09:29.510
Captain, I have to speak.

00:09:29.510 --> 00:09:34.520
Gamlin ! How dare you interrupt my
conversation with the Captain !

00:09:34.520 --> 00:09:37.140
It's alright.
What is it, Lieutenant ?

00:09:37.140 --> 00:09:41.710
Captain, our duty is to
protect the people of City 7.

00:09:41.710 --> 00:09:46.540
As soldiers, our lives should
be put on the line for them.

00:09:46.540 --> 00:09:49.950
Please, give us permission
to go after City 7.

00:09:49.950 --> 00:09:50.910
Captain !

00:09:51.700 --> 00:09:53.370
Very well.

00:09:53.370 --> 00:09:54.770
Thank you, sir !

00:09:55.890 --> 00:10:00.910
Prepare the Fold Boosters
for Diamond Force immediately.

00:10:00.910 --> 00:10:01.770
Yes, sir !

00:10:03.880 --> 00:10:07.870
I got to hand it to you, Ltjg Gamlin.
I feel humbled by you.

00:10:07.870 --> 00:10:09.980
All I did was say
what we stand for.

00:10:09.980 --> 00:10:14.420
Yeah. But, I wonder if the
Fold Booster will work ?

00:10:14.420 --> 00:10:15.500
Huh ?

00:10:18.700 --> 00:10:22.670
3 hours until energy recharge.
Proceeding well.

00:10:31.050 --> 00:10:32.240
Let's do it.

00:10:52.000 --> 00:10:54.540
Abnormal chord-C Spiritia disturbance.
Source located.

00:10:54.540 --> 00:10:55.060
What ?

00:10:55.060 --> 00:10:56.020
This is it.
What ?

00:10:59.930 --> 00:11:02.620
Monitoring Spiritia.
Sample is moving.

00:11:02.620 --> 00:11:05.160
We cannot locate the
sample from this monitor.

00:11:05.160 --> 00:11:08.490
Abnormal chord-C Spiritia
data does not match.

00:11:08.490 --> 00:11:12.180
Wavelength the same.
Zero percent error.

00:11:12.180 --> 00:11:15.100
We must launch forces to
apprehend Spiritia disturbance.

00:11:15.100 --> 00:11:17.580
Elgerzorenes can be
there in 60 seconds.

00:11:17.580 --> 00:11:20.750
No need.
Continue fold operation.

00:11:40.920 --> 00:11:43.030
I've found you, samples !

00:11:55.330 --> 00:11:57.420
Message from Commander Gigil.

00:11:57.420 --> 00:11:58.920
Put him on.

00:11:58.920 --> 00:12:00.530
I've been searching
for you bastards !

00:12:00.530 --> 00:12:04.480
Huh ? What's with that song ?
Why can I hear their song ?

00:12:04.480 --> 00:12:08.800
We've detected an abnormal chord-C Spiritia disturbance within the city sector.

00:12:08.800 --> 00:12:11.760
I know that !
Have you located the source ?

00:12:11.760 --> 00:12:14.050
We're in the process of
energizing fold system.

00:12:14.050 --> 00:12:18.210
You're obeying Gepelnitch's orders,
but you won't obey mine ?

00:12:18.210 --> 00:12:21.320
You had better
prepare yourself !

00:12:21.320 --> 00:12:26.010
Roger. Locate the music's
source with the Elgerzorenes.

00:12:27.820 --> 00:12:31.610
That's better. I'll be
there in about 80 minutes.

00:12:31.610 --> 00:12:36.120
I'm looking forward to
Gepelnitch's Spiritia Farm.

00:12:36.820 --> 00:12:39.380
100 minutes until
energy recharge.

00:12:43.450 --> 00:12:44.770
Here they come.

00:12:47.900 --> 00:12:50.120
Ray, I'm getting
tired of waiting.

00:12:51.120 --> 00:12:55.520
The plan has shifted to phase two.
Your turn is coming up.

00:12:55.520 --> 00:12:57.360
Mylene, Veffidas, start.

00:13:10.850 --> 00:13:14.710
2nd abnormal chord-C Spiritia disturbance
detected, source located.

00:13:14.710 --> 00:13:17.900
Abnormal chord-C disturbance does not match data.

00:13:17.900 --> 00:13:21.040
Refer to past data,
and launch Elgerzorenes.

00:13:21.040 --> 00:13:23.540
Another disturbance
on FZ highway.

00:13:23.540 --> 00:13:25.020
Get confirmation quickly.

00:13:55.300 --> 00:13:56.790
Alright, let's go !

00:14:00.670 --> 00:14:04.800
Mayor, is it really okay
to leave it up to them ?

00:14:04.800 --> 00:14:08.400
Well, we might want
to add a little insurance.

00:14:08.400 --> 00:14:09.310
Insurance ?

00:14:09.310 --> 00:14:10.160
Yep.

00:14:12.870 --> 00:14:14.730
Mayor, where are you...?

00:14:14.730 --> 00:14:17.630
Like I said, to add
a little insurance.

00:14:27.870 --> 00:14:30.400
Damn ! Why do
I have to do this ?

00:14:34.870 --> 00:14:38.300
Source in Central City detected.
Source in City Park detected.

00:14:40.220 --> 00:14:41.650
CV signal detected.

00:14:41.650 --> 00:14:42.520
Data ?

00:14:42.520 --> 00:14:46.060
Records show that there
is only one abnormal chord-C.

00:14:46.060 --> 00:14:48.570
There's no record of multiple
simultaneous occurances.

00:14:48.570 --> 00:14:51.920
If we launch the Elgerzorenes
to investigate all of them...

00:14:51.920 --> 00:14:54.220
...it will affect the
operation of the fold system.

00:14:54.220 --> 00:15:00.890
Fold system energy recharge, 67 minutes.
Rate of operation, down 40%.

00:15:00.890 --> 00:15:03.120
It's been detected in
the Central Area as well.

00:15:07.020 --> 00:15:10.420
Spiritia level 65.
Does not match chord-C.

00:15:11.070 --> 00:15:13.420
That's it, keep following.

00:15:14.350 --> 00:15:15.920
Basara, your turn !

00:15:15.920 --> 00:15:16.920
Okay !

00:15:17.720 --> 00:15:18.720
Let's go !

00:15:35.720 --> 00:15:37.690
You guys ready ?

00:15:37.690 --> 00:15:39.260
I'm ready anytime.

00:15:39.260 --> 00:15:41.150
Are you sure this is okay ?

00:15:41.150 --> 00:15:45.360
My calculations show chances
of success are 50% !

00:15:45.360 --> 00:15:47.360
That's more than enough !

00:15:47.360 --> 00:15:50.350
D-3, there's no turning back now !
Prepare yourself !

00:15:50.350 --> 00:15:51.220
Roger.

00:15:51.220 --> 00:15:52.540
D-Force, fold !

00:15:56.550 --> 00:16:01.420
Spiritia level 65.
Does not match chord-C.

00:16:02.370 --> 00:16:05.920
Spiritia level 62.
Does not match chord-C.

00:16:05.920 --> 00:16:09.890
Time until fold system
recharge, 45 minutes.

00:16:09.890 --> 00:16:11.930
New coordinates
and adjustments input.

00:16:11.930 --> 00:16:15.400
Have the Elgerzorenes return,
no other further confirmations needed.

00:16:18.440 --> 00:16:20.420
Our driving tour
isn't finished yet.

00:16:29.310 --> 00:16:31.210
Are you sure we're
going to be okay ?!

00:16:34.540 --> 00:16:38.170
H...hang on just a while longer !
A little while longer.

00:16:49.920 --> 00:16:54.030
This is Basara. Entry successful.
Heading towards control room.

00:16:54.460 --> 00:16:57.750
The enemy may have
discovered our plan.

00:16:57.750 --> 00:16:59.240
It doesn't matter !

00:17:01.690 --> 00:17:04.480
I needed to stall
30 more minutes.

00:17:05.570 --> 00:17:07.390
It's up to you,  Basara.

00:17:14.380 --> 00:17:16.040
Good luck, Basara.

00:17:19.380 --> 00:17:20.480
W...what ?!

00:17:23.400 --> 00:17:26.930
I've captured a sample
of the abnormal chord-C.

00:17:26.930 --> 00:17:31.300
Elgerzorene XZ, didn't you
hear the orders to abort ?

00:17:31.300 --> 00:17:33.340
Roger. Returning.

00:17:36.420 --> 00:17:37.620
Help !

00:17:51.180 --> 00:17:52.400
Miss Mylene...

00:17:55.510 --> 00:17:56.570
There it is !

00:17:56.570 --> 00:18:00.050
This is D2.
City 7 at 12 o'clock !

00:18:00.050 --> 00:18:01.120
What ?!

00:18:01.120 --> 00:18:02.060
You're right !

00:18:02.060 --> 00:18:04.470
I'm coming to
save you, Miss Mylene !

00:18:06.760 --> 00:18:07.500
What the...?!

00:18:08.250 --> 00:18:11.060
Pests way out here !

00:18:13.410 --> 00:18:14.430
Damn !

00:18:14.430 --> 00:18:17.540
This is D1 !
Battle formation RF !

00:18:17.540 --> 00:18:18.500
Roger !

00:18:21.820 --> 00:18:25.380
9 minutes until
fold system recharged.

00:18:25.380 --> 00:18:30.000
Before folding,
return to your positions.

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:32.120
You're planning to fold again ?

00:18:32.970 --> 00:18:35.970
Fold system
ready to activate.

00:18:35.970 --> 00:18:37.840
Activate fold system.

00:18:37.840 --> 00:18:39.310
Activating fold system.

00:18:39.710 --> 00:18:43.620
8 minutes until fold
out to preset coordinates.

00:18:45.970 --> 00:18:53.180
...I want to become the endless sky.

00:18:53.180 --> 00:18:54.960
Abnormal chord-C Spiritia !

00:18:56.820 --> 00:19:03.220
When I'm lost in a strong rain...

00:19:03.220 --> 00:19:04.220
Basara !

00:19:06.280 --> 00:19:07.540
M...Mylene ?!

00:19:12.020 --> 00:19:12.960
Basara !

00:19:15.350 --> 00:19:16.830
What are you doing here ?

00:19:17.550 --> 00:19:20.250
5 minutes 30 seconds
until fold.

00:19:41.930 --> 00:19:43.870
Oh, no !
It's folding again !

00:19:47.720 --> 00:19:50.700
Move it !
I don't have time to fight !

00:19:53.110 --> 00:19:54.950
I said move it !

00:20:05.300 --> 00:20:06.870
Fold in 5 minutes.

00:20:07.250 --> 00:20:08.270
Basara !

00:20:11.930 --> 00:20:12.720
Damn !

00:20:19.500 --> 00:20:20.240
Mama !

00:20:29.820 --> 00:20:32.070
Looks like the insurance
made it in time.

00:20:32.480 --> 00:20:33.890
M...Mama...

00:20:34.340 --> 00:20:36.080
Oh, I didn't know
you were there.

00:20:44.070 --> 00:20:47.160
Risk of damaging fold system.
Cease attack.

00:20:53.080 --> 00:20:54.840
Mylene, get to
the fold system !

00:20:55.840 --> 00:20:56.870
O...okay !

00:21:06.870 --> 00:21:10.300
I don't understand !
Mama, what am I supposed to do ?

00:21:10.970 --> 00:21:13.020
Push the fold system
"down'' button !

00:21:15.170 --> 00:21:16.810
Mama, it won't stop !

00:21:17.690 --> 00:21:23.170
Change the coordinates.
First, reset the X/Y/Z axis...

00:21:23.170 --> 00:21:27.410
...and set auto-lock to the
Macross fleet on the panel.

00:21:27.890 --> 00:21:29.890
Hurry !  We only
have 25 seconds !

00:21:30.210 --> 00:21:32.320
Don't say it like that !

00:21:42.060 --> 00:21:44.220
I can't do it !

00:21:44.220 --> 00:21:45.520
Mylene, stand aside.

00:21:46.320 --> 00:21:48.570
To stop a machine like this,
you have to hit it !

00:21:51.320 --> 00:21:52.370
No way !

00:21:56.270 --> 00:21:58.720
Oh...oh, no !
This can't be !

00:21:59.840 --> 00:22:00.930
Those bastards !

00:22:03.920 --> 00:22:05.550
Dammit !

00:22:17.290 --> 00:22:19.850
What're we going to do ?

00:22:22.550 --> 00:22:26.950
At least we
escaped the enemy...

00:22:26.950 --> 00:22:30.120
Yup, at least
for now, we're OK.

00:22:31.320 --> 00:22:35.120
What do you mean "OK'' ?
Do you know the meaning of "OK'' ?

00:22:35.120 --> 00:22:38.930
This isn't funny !
What're we gonna do now ?!

00:22:39.540 --> 00:22:41.020
We'll think of something.

00:22:43.460 --> 00:22:44.420
Basara, you...!

00:23:07.210 --> 00:23:13.390
Our voices synchronize just like falling in love and kissing.

00:23:16.220 --> 00:23:23.530
My heart is always here for you.

00:23:25.630 --> 00:23:30.700
But, oh! I wonder what your shining eyes...

00:23:31.810 --> 00:23:39.680
...are searching for ? Oh, My Friends !

00:23:40.870 --> 00:23:51.360
I'm going to run with you toward a star where our dreams are.

00:23:53.260 --> 00:24:03.070
When we look at each other everything will become real.

00:24:11.450 --> 00:24:13.120
Preview

00:24:13.120 --> 00:24:15.920
Basara, what will our
next audience be like ?

00:24:15.920 --> 00:24:17.470
It doesn't really matter.

00:24:17.470 --> 00:24:19.220
